Two more distinctions matter. The sealed text calls \(r^*\) a power-control setpoint, so missing it is not by itself a violation of a promised rate. And same-satellite interference shares the wanted signal’s fading in this engine; in that case, freezing interference at nominal is conservative. The numerical checks are separating that case from interference coming from other satellites.
